<title>USA: Chad Therapeutics board authorizes buyback.</title>
<headline>Chad Therapeutics board authorizes buyback.</headline>
<dateline>CHATSWORTH, Calif 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chad Therapeutics Inc said its board of directors authorized the company to acquire shares of its common stock in open market transactions.</p>
<p>The board of directors did not impose a specific limitation on the number of shares which may be purchased, but will monitor such purchases on an ongoing basis.</p>
</text>
